          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayakuletha bonke abafowenu kube ngumhlatshelo kuJehova bevela ezizweni zonke begibele amahhashi, nangezinqola, nangezikebhe, naphezu kweminyuzi, nangezilwane ezinejubane, entabeni yami engcwele eJerusalema,” usho uJehova, “njengalokho abantwana bakwa-Israyeli beletha. “Umnikelo ngesitsha esihlambulukileyo endlini kaJehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
