              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusukela ekwethwaseni kwenyanga kuye kwenye, kusukela kwelinye isabatha kuye kwelinye, yonke inyama iyakuza ukukhuleka phambi kwami,” usho uJehova.",
          "type": "text",
